<title>USA: National Semiconductor Q3 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>National Semiconductor Q3 earnings summary.</headline>
<text>
<p>SANTA CLARA, Calif., March 6 (Reuter)</p>
<p>		   Feb 23 1997		Feb 25 1996</p>
<p> Shr profit	$0.30	  profit  $0.17</p>
<p> Shr dil profit  $0.30	  profit  $0.17</p>
<p> Net profit	42,800	 profit  23,000</p>
<p> Revs		680,500		  600,300</p>
<p> Avg shr primary 143,800		  137,800</p>
<p> Avg shr diluted 150,000		  137,800</p>
<p>9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $0.97	  profit  $1.30</p>
<p> Shr dil loss    $0.97	  profit  $1.26</p>
<p> Net loss	  135,300	profit  176,300</p>
<p> Revs		1,908,100		2,010,700</p>
<p> Avg shr primary 139,000		  131,100</p>
<p> Avg shr diluted 139,000		  142,600</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note - Results of fiscal 1997 nine months includes a pretax xharge of $285.6 million taken in the first quarter.</p>
</text>
